## Interface: 16001, 11508, 11509
## Title: WoW Forever Sync
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Gear_01
## Notes: Exports your character, gear, bags and bank for the WoW Forever gear and DPS tool.
## Author: WoW Forever Tools
## Version: 1.2.0
## SavedVariables: WoWForeverSyncDB

# 16001 is the Forever client, which runs on the Midnight engine. Without it the
# addon shows as out of date and does not load. The other two are Classic Era
# 1.15.8 and 1.15.9. If a patch moves the number, read the new one in game with
#   /run print(select(4, GetBuildInfo()))
# and add it to the list.
#
# Releasing to CurseForge also wants a project id here, once the project exists:
#   ## X-Curse-Project-ID: 000000
# See addon/RELEASING.md in the repository.

json.lua
scan.lua
export.lua
ui.lua
